{"arena": "Z", "t": 1792901156.8, "seq": 78, "op": "mutate", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "cost": 0.0006232400000000001, "parents": ["Z23"], "log": {"edges": [["score", "cast_value", "call"], ["score", "progress", "call"]], "n_edges": 2, "editable": ["Z26a", "s1", "s4"], "llm": {"in": 864, "out": 965, "cache_read": 5434, "cache_write": 0, "seconds": 4.7, "stop": "end_turn"}, "genes_changed": ["s4"], "genes_added": [], "genes_removed": [], "added_sizes": [], "lines_changed": 5, "keeps_added": [], "pruned": []}, "error": "behavioural twin", "fingerprint": null, "twin_of": "Z23", "birth": 37, "accepted": false}
{"arena": "Z", "t": 1792901165.1, "seq": 81, "op": "mutate", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "cost": 0.0008370399999999999, "parents": ["Z31"], "log": {"edges": [["score", "cast_value", "call"], ["progress", "goal_field", "call"]], "n_edges": 2, "editable": ["Z26a", "s1", "s3", "s4"], "llm": {"in": 962, "out": 1373, "cache_read": 5434, "cache_write": 0, "seconds": 6.0, "stop": "end_turn"}, "reply": "The change targets two links. `cast_value` now scales damage on enemy champions by how hurt they are, and it lowers shield/heal to a sustained-fight rule that weighs nearby enemy strength. `goal_field` now reads a per-turn `Field` keep computed once in a new `update()`, which avoids rebuilding the distance field on every pass of the loop.\n\n```python\nGOAL_F: Field = None\n\n\n@gene(\"u1\", \"compute the goal distance field once per turn\", parents=[\"s3\"])\ndef update() -> None:\n    GOAL_F = field(goals())\n\n\n@gene(\"s3\", \"distance field to the goals, computed once per turn\", parents=[\"s3\"])\ndef goal_field() -> Field:\n    return GOAL_F\n\n\n@gene('Z26a', 'value of casting an ability: focus damage on weakened enemy champions, shield/heal when hurt with enemy strength nearby', parents=['s1'])\ndef cast_value(o: Option) -> Num:\n    k = slot_kind(o.slot)\n    if k == AB_DAMAGE or k == AB_AOE or k == AB_CC:\n        if exists(o.unit):\n            if o.unit.is_champion and o.unit.is_enemy:\n                return 100 + 60 * (1 - o.unit.health_frac)\n            if o.unit.is_camp and gems() == 0:\n                return 65\n        return 0\n    if k == AB_SHIELD or k == AB_HEAL:\n        near = sum(u.strength for u in enemies() if dist(u.pos, me().pos) <= 4)\n        if me().health_frac < 0.6 and near > 0:\n            return 90 if me().health_frac < 0.35 else 70\n        return 0\n    return 0\n```"}, "error": "GenomeError: cast_value line 67: cannot assign to near", "birth": 37, "accepted": false, "fingerprint": null}
