{"arena": "Z", "t": 1792901174.2, "seq": 84, "op": "mutate", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "cost": 0.00044964, "parents": ["Z38"], "log": {"edges": [["score", "progress", "call"]], "n_edges": 1, "editable": ["s1", "s4"], "llm": {"in": 698, "out": 651, "cache_read": 5434, "cache_write": 0, "seconds": 3.2, "stop": "end_turn"}, "reply": "The change is to `progress`: a step now loses value for each enemy within 3 tiles of the destination, weighted more heavily when hurt, so the bot stops walking into fights on the way to goals. `score` is unchanged.\n\n```python\n@gene('s4', 'progress toward goals, doubled when healthy, minus a penalty for enemies near the destination tile', parents=['s4'])\ndef progress(t: Tile) -> Num:\n    d = at(goal_field(), me().pos) - at(goal_field(), t)\n    danger = count(1 for u in enemies() if dist(u.pos, t) <= 3)\n    if me().health_frac > 0.6:\n        return d * 2 - danger * 2\n    return d - danger * 3\n```"}, "error": "GenomeError: progress line 50: expected Bool, got Num", "birth": 38, "accepted": false, "fingerprint": null}
